# A replacement effect applies to the event as it happens (CR 614.1, 614.4): Bot1 Bolts Bot2 on its own turn 3 with
# Bloodletter of Aclazotz on the battlefield, and Bot2 answers with Swords to Plowshares on Bloodletter. Bot1 gains 2
# (Bloodletter's power: 20 -> 22, not doubled - it is no loss and Bot1 no opponent), and when the Bolt resolves there is
# no Bloodletter left: Bot2 loses 3, not 6 (20 -> 17).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Bloodletter of Aclazotz
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Swamp x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Swords to Plowshares
Island x18

