Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bloodletter of Aclazotz.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bloodletter of Aclazotz)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 22
? Exile = Bloodletter of Aclazotz
